1. Go to **Shop > Add Item > Digital Download**.
2. **Name:** `{{ copy.short_title }}`
3. **Price:** ${{ "%.2f"|format(price) }}
4. **Image:** `{{ square }}` (square, 1000 x 1000)
5. **Files:**
{% for f in files %}   - `{{ f }}`
{% endfor %}6. **Description:** paste
```
{{ description }}
```
7. Publish, then add the item link to your Ko-fi page header and your Pinterest bio.

Ko-fi works best when you already have an audience (Pinterest, Instagram, YouTube), since it has little built-in product search.
